# ============================================================================
# Application Runtime Data
# ============================================================================

# SQLite databases
db.sqlite3
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# User-uploaded application data. `uploads/` is unanchored on purpose so it
# matches backend/uploads/ wherever it sits.
uploads/

# Generated blog media — mirrored from the CMS at build time.
**/public/media/blog/

# ============================================================================
# Generated Files
# ============================================================================

# Generated by the TanStack Router plugin / npm run routes.
# Regenerated from src/routes/ and should not be committed.
# (ignored above via **/src/routeTree.gen.ts)

# Blog content is deliberately absent from this repository. Posts live in the
# CMS database and are fetched at runtime, so there is nothing here to ignore
# and nothing to drift out of sync with what is published.

# ============================================================================
# Database Migrations
# ============================================================================

# IMPORTANT:
# Do NOT ignore drizzle/.
#
# Drizzle migrations and drizzle/meta/ are version-controlled schema history.
# They must remain committed so migrations can be generated and applied
# correctly across environments.

